@api = http://localhost:8080

### Creer une partie (defauts PvE) -> PlacingFleet
POST {{api}}/api/games

### Creer une partie (options PvE)
POST {{api}}/api/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "boardSize": 10,
  "difficulty": "Normal"
}

### Creer une partie PvP (attente join)
POST {{api}}/api/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "VsPlayer",
  "boardSize": 10
}

### Rejoindre une partie PvP
@pvpGameId = 8f2abcce-05e7-4cb1-b8c9-34f60f34f9d5
@player1Token = 99e4cb99670b4730a8e266d04cce6339
@player2Token = d964ce7a48be40cbb3042a60cdc7a87d
POST {{api}}/api/games/{{pvpGameId}}/join

### Creer une partie — validation echouee
POST {{api}}/api/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "boardSize": 4
}

### Lire une partie PvE (remplacer l'id apres POST /api/games solo)
@pveGameId = afa46ed6-2946-4168-b9a7-bf2dace22246
GET {{api}}/api/games/{{pveGameId}}

### Lire une partie inconnue
GET {{api}}/api/games/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### PvE — placer la flotte (status PlacingFleet -> PlayerTurn)
POST {{api}}/api/games/{{pveGameId}}/fleet
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ships": [
    { "name": "Porte-avions", "x": 0, "y": 0, "horizontal": true },
    { "name": "Croiseur", "x": 0, "y": 1, "horizontal": true },
    { "name": "Contre-torpilleur", "x": 0, "y": 2, "horizontal": true },
    { "name": "Sous-marin", "x": 0, "y": 3, "horizontal": true },
    { "name": "Torpilleur", "x": 0, "y": 4, "horizontal": true }
  ]
}

### PvP — placer flotte joueur 1 (Waiting ou PlacingFleet)
POST {{api}}/api/games/{{pvpGameId}}/fleet
Content-Type: application/json
X-Player-Token: {{player1Token}}

{
  "ships": [
    { "name": "Porte-avions", "x": 0, "y": 0, "horizontal": true },
    { "name": "Croiseur", "x": 0, "y": 1, "horizontal": true },
    { "name": "Contre-torpilleur", "x": 0, "y": 2, "horizontal": true },
    { "name": "Sous-marin", "x": 0, "y": 3, "horizontal": true },
    { "name": "Torpilleur", "x": 0, "y": 4, "horizontal": true }
  ]
}

### PvP — placer flotte joueur 2 (apres join)
POST {{api}}/api/games/{{pvpGameId}}/fleet
Content-Type: application/json
X-Player-Token: {{player2Token}}

{
  "ships": [
    { "name": "Porte-avions", "x": 0, "y": 0, "horizontal": true },
    { "name": "Croiseur", "x": 0, "y": 1, "horizontal": true },
    { "name": "Contre-torpilleur", "x": 0, "y": 2, "horizontal": true },
    { "name": "Sous-marin", "x": 0, "y": 3, "horizontal": true },
    { "name": "Torpilleur", "x": 0, "y": 4, "horizontal": true }
  ]
}

### PvE — tir joueur (pas de header, status PlayerTurn)
POST {{api}}/api/games/{{pveGameId}}/shots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "x": 4,
  "y": 7
}

### PvE — tir ordinateur (pas de header, body vide, status ComputerTurn)
POST {{api}}/api/games/{{pveGameId}}/shots
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### PvE — case deja jouee (409)
POST {{api}}/api/games/{{pveGameId}}/shots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "x": 4,
  "y": 7
}

### PvP — tir joueur 1 (header obligatoire, status Player1Turn)
POST {{api}}/api/games/{{pvpGameId}}/shots
Content-Type: application/json
X-Player-Token: {{player1Token}}

{
  "x": 1,
  "y": 1
}

### PvP — tir joueur 2 (header obligatoire, status Player2Turn)
POST {{api}}/api/games/{{pvpGameId}}/shots
Content-Type: application/json
X-Player-Token: {{player2Token}}

{
  "x": 2,
  "y": 3
}

### PvP — tir sans token (401)
POST {{api}}/api/games/{{pvpGameId}}/shots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "x": 0,
  "y": 0
}
